2. The case of the petitioner in the nutshell is that on 28.08.2023 at about 4.30 to 4.40 p.m the petitioner was traveling as a passenger in an offending KSRTC Bus bearing Reg.No.KA-42-F-1745,
from Kanakapura side towards Halaguru side, when she reached near Kemmale Gate, NH-948 road,
Malavalli Kanakapura road, Sathanoor Hobli, Kanakapura Taluk, Ramanagara District, at that point of time the driver of KSRTC bus bearing Reg.No.KA-42-F-1745 has driven with high speed, driven on extreme its right side road in a rash and negligent manner so as to endangering to human life and dashed against the Toyota car bearing Reg.No.KA-01-MF-8055 and dragged the car at a distance of 50 to 75 feet from the accident spot towards the car side road, in which the car was proceeding on correct side and caused the accident.
